    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this charming detached bungalow on circa 0.33 acre, located in Julianstown, Co. Meath.\n\nThe accommodation which requires modernisation comprises: Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Dining Room, Conservatory, 5 Bedrooms and Bathroom. The central heating is oil fired and windows are double glazed. Mature private gardens surround the property.\n\nLocated south of the village, with access to a range of local amenities such as shop, restaurant, golf course, primary school and church. Further amenities can be located in the nearby towns of Balbriggan to the south and Drogheda just 10km north. For the commuter, access to the M1 motorway is a 3 minute drive. Great opportunity for discerning client to acquire a fantastic property, with great potential.\nViewing highly recommended.\n\nFEATURES\n•5 Bedroom Detached Bungalow on circa 0.33 acre\n•Requires Modernisation\n•Oil fired Central Heating\n•Double Glazed Windows\n•Mature Gardens to rear.\n•Fabulous beach just a short drive\n•Adjacent to main bus route. \n•M1 Motorway a 3 minute drive\n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hall\n4.9m x 1.6mCarpet floor.\n\nSitting Room\n3.6m x 2.9m\nCarpet floor, fireplace. \n\nBedroom 1 \n3.6m x 3.0m\nCarpet floor.\n\nBathroom\n2.4m x 1.8m\nLinoleum floor, Shower.\n\nLiving Room\n5.4m x 4.4m\nCarpet floor, patio doors to lean-to.\n\nKitchen\n5.4m x 1.7m\nTiled floor, Fitted Kitchen units.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.3m x 2.5mCarpet floor.\n\nBedroom 3\n2.6m x 2.1mCarpet floor.\n\nBedroom 4\n2.6m x 2.1mCarpet floor. \n\nBedroom 5\n3.1m x 3.2mCarpet floor.\n"
      },
